  "description": "No husband? No problem!\n\nA group of plucky, unmarried women is stirring up trouble in Joseon, a land of conservative and traditional values. The goal: make money and solve crimes! The ladies of the Spinsters' Association, along with womanizer Eunho, set about investigating the mysterious disappearances of local women...\n\n(Source: Manta)",
